WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:02.170
- [Narrator] In Fall River, Massachusetts,

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.430
you will find a sandwich
with Chinese roots

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.963
and American stylings.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.630
Mostly noodles bookended
by hamburger buns,

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.070
the Chow Mein sandwich is unique

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.469
in its taste, texture, and history.

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:16.969
(light music)

00:00:20.627 --> 00:00:23.210
(bright music)

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:40.764
(man speaks faintly)

00:02:33.846 --> 00:02:37.286
(light music)
(people speaking faintly)

00:02:37.286 --> 00:02:39.869
(bright music)

